<div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-2 sm:px-3 py-8">
  <div class="flex justify-between items-center mb-8">
    <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-800 dark:text-gray-100">기사생성기</h1>
    <%= link_to '새 기사 작성', new_article_path, class: "px-4 py-2 bg-blue-600 text-white rounded-lg font-semibold hover:bg-blue-700 transition" %>
  </div>

  <%# 기사 생성기 소개 토글 (취지, 모델, 장점) %>
  <div class="mb-8" data-controller="toggle">
    <button type="button"
            data-action="click->toggle#toggle"
            data-toggle-target="trigger"
            class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-4 py-2 rounded-lg bg-amber-50 dark:bg-amber-900/20 text-amber-800 dark:text-amber-200 border border-amber-200 dark:border-amber-800 hover:bg-amber-100 dark:hover:bg-amber-900/30 transition">
      <svg data-toggle-target="iconOpen" class="w-5 h-5 shrink-0" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true">
        <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M13 16h-1v-4h-1m1-4h.01M21 12a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z" />
      </svg>
      <svg data-toggle-target="iconClose" class="w-5 h-5 shrink-0 hidden" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true">
        <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 15l7-7 7 7" />
      </svg>
      <span>기사 생성기가 뭐예요?</span>
    </button>
    <div data-toggle-target="content" class="hidden mt-4 p-5 rounded-xl bg-white dark:bg-gray-800 border border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-700 shadow-sm">
      <div class="space-y-4 text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300 text-sm leading-relaxed">
        <div>
          <h3 class="font-semibold text-amber-700 dark:text-amber-300 mb-1">취지</h3>
          <p>키워드와 문체만 골라 주시면, AI가 제목 후보랑 본문까지 쭉 써 줘요. 뉴스처럼 딱딱하게 할 수도 있고, 블로그·에세이·소설 톤처럼 부드럽게 할 수도 있어요. 그냥 "이런 얘기로 글 써 줘"만 하면 돼요.</p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h3 class="font-semibold text-amber-700 dark:text-amber-300 mb-1">모델</h3>
          <p>Google의 Gemini API를 써서 문장을 만들어요. 그래서 제목 추천이랑 본문 품질이 괜찮고, 문체 바꾸는 것도 잘 따라와요.</p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h3 class="font-semibold text-amber-700 dark:text-amber-300 mb-1">장점</h3>
          <ul class="list-disc list-inside space-y-1">
            <li>키워드만 넣으면 제목 후보 3개 + 본문까지 한 번에 나와요.</li>
            <li>문체(공식문서, 신문기사, 블로그, 에세이, 소설가)를 바꿔 가며 여러 느낌으로 시험해 볼 수 있어요.</li>
            <li>프롬프트를 수정한 뒤 "기사 재생성"만 누르면 다시 만들어 줘요.</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <% if notice.present? %>
    <div class="mb-4 p-4 bg-green-100 text-green-700 rounded-lg">
      <%= notice %>
    </div>
  <% end %>

  <div class="bg-white rounded-xl shadow-md overflow-hidden border border-gray-200">
    <% if @articles.any? %>
      <table class="w-full articles-table">
        <thead class="bg-gray-100">
          <tr>
            <th class="px-6 py-3 text-left text-sm font-semibold text-gray-800">제목</th>
            <th class="px-6 py-3 text-left text-sm font-semibold text-gray-800 hidden sm:table-cell">키워드</th>
            <th class="px-6 py-3 text-left text-sm font-semibold text-gray-800 hidden md:table-cell">생성일</th>
            <th class="px-3 py-3 text-right text-sm font-semibold text-gray-800 w-0 whitespace-nowrap" style="min-width: 4.5rem;">작업</th>
          </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody class="divide-y divide-gray-200">
          <% @articles.each do |article| %>
            <tr class="article-row transition">
              <td class="px-6 py-4 text-gray-900">
                <%= link_to article.title, article, class: "text-blue-700 hover:text-blue-900 font-medium underline-offset-2 hover:underline" %>
              </td>
              <td class="px-6 py-4 text-gray-700 text-sm hidden sm:table-cell">
                <%= article.keywords.to_s.truncate(30) %>
              </td>
              <td class="px-6 py-4 text-gray-700 text-sm hidden md:table-cell">
                <%= article.created_at.strftime("%Y-%m-%d %H:%M") %>
              </td>
              <td class="px-3 py-4 text-right w-0 whitespace-nowrap" style="min-width: 4.5rem;">
                <% if user_signed_in? && article.editable_by?(current_user) %>
                  <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-0.5 flex-nowrap flex-shrink-0 justify-end">
                    <%= link_to edit_article_path(article), class: "inline-flex items-center justify-center w-7 h-7 rounded text-gray-600 hover:bg-gray-100 transition", title: "수정" do %>
                      <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M15.232 5.232l3.536 3.536m-2.036-5.036a2.5 2.5 0 113.536 3.536L6.5 21.036H3v-3.572L16.732 3.732z"/></svg>
                    <% end %>
                    <%= link_to article, method: :delete, data: { turbo_method: :delete, turbo_confirm: "정말 삭제하시겠습니까?" }, class: "inline-flex items-center justify-center w-7 h-7 rounded text-red-600 hover:bg-red-50 transition", title: "삭제" do %>
                      <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 7l-.867 12.142A2 2 0 0116.138 21H7.862a2 2 0 01-1.995-1.858L5 7m5 4v6m4-6v6m1-10V4a1 1 0 00-1-1h-4a1 1 0 00-1 1v3M4 7h16"/></svg>
                    <% end %>
                  </div>
                <% else %>
                  <span class="text-gray-400 text-sm">—</span>
                <% end %>
              </td>
            </tr>
          <% end %>
        </tbody>
      </table>
    <% else %>
      <div class="p-8 text-center text-gray-500">
        아직 생성된 기사가 없습니다. 새 기사를 작성해보세요!
      </div>
    <% end %>
  </div>

  <% if defined?(@pagy) && @pagy.pages > 1 %>
    <div class="mt-6">
      <%== pagy_nav(@pagy) %>
    </div>
  <% end %>
</div>

<style>
  /* 작업 열: 수정·삭제 아이콘 한 줄 고정 */
  .articles-table td:last-child,
  .articles-table th:last-child { white-space: nowrap !important; min-width: 4.5rem; }
  .articles-table .article-row td:last-child .inline-flex { flex-wrap: nowrap !important; }
  /* 호버 시에도 글씨가 항상 보이도록 대비 */
  .articles-table .article-row:hover { background-color: rgba(243, 232, 215, 0.5); }
  .articles-table .article-row:hover td { color: #1f2937; }
  .articles-table .article-row:hover td a { color: #1d4ed8; }
  .articles-table .article-row:hover .text-red-600 { color: #dc2626 !important; }
  .articles-table .article-row:hover .text-gray-400 { color: #6b7280 !important; }
</style>
